<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾰθᾰνᾰτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aim at immortality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				156d
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1177b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>deify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				150.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span> Inscr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν ψυχήν</span>
			<i>represent</i> it <i>as immortal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				90.26
			</span></i>; <i>make perpetual,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς ἀ. τὰ γένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τοῦ πυρὸς ἀ. τοῖς θεοῖς τὰς
					τιμάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					2.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become immortal, earn immortality,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ ἀπαθανατιζόμεναι,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθαρτὰ σώματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.427
			</span></i>; <i>become a god,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				45.7
			</span></i>.</div>
